  "release_notes_md": "## v0.7.1 \u2014 Maintenance release\n\nA small maintenance release on top of v0.7.0. No user-facing feature changes.\n\n- **Database packaging cleanup.** The bundled PostgreSQL 16 service is now named\n  consistently across the stack. Existing installs are unaffected; the update\n  catalog's database image reference is corrected to `postgres:16.4`.\n- **Dashboard internals.** Removed retired per-industry preset code (the\n  capability-gated dashboard introduced in v0.7.0 is the sole driver). No change\n  to existing dashboards.\n- **Support-pack signing key rotated** to `vendor-prod-2026-r2`.\n",
